List<String> ips=new ArrayList<String>(CredentialVault.listAssignedDevices());Collections.sort(ips);final Map<String,Properties> credentials=new LinkedHashMap<String,Properties>();for(String ip:ips)try{String id=CredentialVault.getDeviceCredentialId(ip,CredentialVault.TYPE_SSH);if(id==null||id.length()==0)continue;Properties ssh=CredentialVault.getCredential(id);if(CredentialVault.TYPE_SSH.equals(ssh.getProperty("type"))&&"true".equalsIgnoreCase(ssh.getProperty("enabled","true")))credentials.put(ip,ssh);}catch(Exception ignored){}
final Map<String,DeviceMetadata> metadata=new ConcurrentHashMap<String,DeviceMetadata>();int workers=Math.max(1,Math.min(8,credentials.size()));ExecutorService executor=Executors.newFixedThreadPool(workers,new ThreadFactory(){public Thread newThread(Runnable runnable){Thread thread=new Thread(runnable,"fn-acli-api-snmp");thread.setDaemon(true);return thread;}});List<Callable<Void>> tasks=new ArrayList<Callable<Void>>();for(final String ip:credentials.keySet())tasks.add(new Callable<Void>(){public Void call(){metadata.put(ip,loadMetadata(ip));return null;}});try{executor.invokeAll(tasks,15,TimeUnit.SECONDS);}finally{executor.shutdownNow();}
if("HEAD".equals(request.getMethod()))return;StringBuilder payload=new StringBuilder("{\"apiVersion\":1,\"fabricNavigatorVersion\":\"").append(json(System.getenv("FABRICNAVIGATOR_VERSION"))).append("\",\"generatedAt\":\"").append(Instant.now().toString()).append("\",\"devices\":[");int count=0;for(Map.Entry<String,Properties> item:credentials.entrySet()){if(count++>0)payload.append(',');DeviceMetadata current=metadata.get(item.getKey());if(current==null)current=new DeviceMetadata();payload.append(deviceJson(item.getKey(),item.getValue(),current));}payload.append("]}");out.print(payload.toString());try{AuditLog.log("api:"+FabricNavigatorApiToken.label(),"FABRICNAVIGATOR_API_READ","exported "+count+" SSH session"+(count==1?"":"s"),request.getRemoteAddr());}catch(Exception ignored){}
